OPEN-CORE MODEL
This repository uses a two-tier licensing model, similar to MongoDB (SSPL) and
HashiCorp (BSL). The goal is to protect the project from cloud-provider
extraction while keeping the Community tier fully open for developers.

  * Community modules (exeris-kernel-spi, exeris-kernel-core,
    exeris-kernel-community, exeris-kernel-tck) are free to use, modify, and
    distribute for any purpose, including production. See each module's
    README for its specific licence terms.

  * Enterprise modules (exeris-kernel-enterprise) are subject to the
    commercial licence terms below. Contact legal@exeris.eu to obtain a
    commercial licence.

The terms below apply to the Enterprise modules and to any module not
explicitly designated as Community in its README.

